{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "inbound/a-transport-s-reply-record-is-the-caller-s-too",
  "title": "A transport whose turn writes a record replies as an agent does: its record is the caller's and its end goes under the caller's turns, beside the agents'; a transport whose turn writes none adds nothing",
  "rules": [
    "§6.4",
    "§10.1 step 18"
  ],
  "notes": "Python: core/mixins/lane_execution.py _settle_buffered_replies merges every target's on_event() output in result.outputs, a transport's included (record_buffered_reply: merge_channel_record, then add_turn_entry with reply_turn_entry), core/event_router.py _merged keeping each target's output. watch, a transport, returns t and its end; plain, a transport whose turn returns nothing, has no entry; bot, an agent, returns a and its end.",
  "setup": {
    "channels": [
      {
        "id": "sms",
        "type": "sms",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "watch",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "output": {
              "response_metadata": {
                "t": 1,
                "loop_end_reason": "completed"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "plain",
        "type": "websocket",
        "category": "transport"
      },
      {
        "id": "bot",
        "type": "ai",
        "category": "intelligence",
        "on_event": [
          {
            "when": {
              "text": "hi"
            },
            "respond": [
              {
                "content": {
                  "type": "text",
                  "body": "Done."
                }
              }
            ],
            "output": {
              "response_metadata": {
                "a": 1,
                "loop_end_reason": "max_rounds"
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "rooms": [
      {
        "id": "room-1",
        "bindings": [
          {
            "channel_id": "sms"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "watch"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "plain"
          },
          {
            "channel_id": "bot"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "call": "process_inbound",
      "room_id": "room-1",
      "message": {
        "channel_id": "sms",
        "sender_id": "+15551234567",
        "content": {
          "type": "text",
          "body": "hi"
        }
      },
      "expect": {
        "result": {
          "blocked": false,
          "response_metadata": {
            "t": 1,
            "a": 1,
            "loop_end_reason": {
              "$absent": true
            },
            "turns": {
              "watch": {
                "loop_end_reason": "completed"
              },
              "bot": {
                "loop_end_reason": "max_rounds"
              },
              "plain": {
                "$absent": true
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "idle": true
    }
  ]
}
